# The FX menu's four knobs: Filter (bipolar DJ filter), Crush, Throw, Wash. They are the engine's, not a
# piece's: not stored. The audio (fxknobs.wav) has each in its own stretch, for listening:
#   4 s filter left (low-pass) 3 s, 7 s filter right (high-pass) 3 s, 10 s crush 3 s, 13 s throw 3 s, 16 s wash 3 s
wait 4000
wav fxknobs.wav
tap FX
wait 200
shot fxknobs_menu.png
# 4 s: low-pass, knob 1 turned left
spin K1 -30
wait 300
shot fxknobs_lp.png
wait 2700
spin K1 30
wait 3000
# 7 s: high-pass, knob 1 right
spin K1 30
wait 300
shot fxknobs_hp.png
wait 2700
spin K1 -30
wait 3000
# 10 s: crush up to the top, then back
spin K2 100
wait 300
shot fxknobs_crush.png
wait 2700
spin K2 -100
wait 3000
# 13 s: throw
spin K3 60
wait 3000
spin K3 -60
wait 3000
# 16 s: wash
spin K4 70
wait 300
shot fxknobs_wash.png
wait 2700
spin K4 -70
wait 2000
tap FX
wait 200
shot fxknobs_closed.png
wavstop
